# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_2000001> (is location of)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_2000001> "A relation between a phenotypically related anatomical entity and a phenotype, where the phenotype is located in the phenotypically related anatomical entity.")
